# Aclazotz: "Whenever Aclazotz attacks, each opponent discards a card. For each opponent who can't, you draw a card."
# Bot2 holds a card to discard, so it chooses (Lightning Bolt, a nonland card) and discards it; no opponent can't, so
# Bot1 draws nothing, and a nonland discard makes no Bat. Aclazotz (flying, lifelink) is unblocked: 4 damage, 4 life.
# Bot1 turn 1: Black Lotus (BBB), Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl pay {3}{B}{B}; turn 3: it attacks. Bot1's hand: 7 - Lotus, Moxen (2),
# Aclazotz, Swamp = 2 Swamps, plus the turn-3 draw = 3. Bot2: 7 + draw - Mountain = 7, minus the discard = 6.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain
Island
Plains
Plains
Plains
Swamp x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Aclazotz, Deepest Betrayal > Bot2)
Bot2.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
